# Contributing to Hotel Reservation System

Thank you for your interest in contributing to the Hotel Reservation System project! Your contributions help improve the system and make it more robust for all users.

## How to Contribute

1. Fork the repository or create a branch from the main project folder.
2. Make your changes in a clean and descriptive way.
3. Follow the existing coding style and naming conventions.
4. Test your changes manually before submitting.
5. Add documentation updates for any feature or bug-fix changes.

## Suggestions for Contributions

- Bug fixes in PHP files, JavaScript, or CSS
- Improvements to authentication and user flow
- Enhanced reservation and payment handling
- UI/UX polish for dashboards and forms
- Security or validation improvements

## Submitting Your Work

- If using Git, create a clear commit message.
- Provide a short description of what was changed.
- If possible, include any steps to reproduce or verify the fix.

Thanks for helping make this project better!
